github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T12:33:06Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T12:34:41Z","body":"Yes, \"very unlikely\" does not mean impossible :)\r\n\r\nUsers often manage to pull off some truly mind-boggling actions, especially when dealing with git conflicts. Renaming `.uid` files around without moving the corresponding resource file creates this situation easily.\r\n\r\nI really don't want to discuss this here. This is technically off-topic.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3562838416/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3562894725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113005#issuecomment-3562894725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113005","id":3562894725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UXXWF","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Iv